<title>GERMANY: Mannesmann takes stake in Cegetel.</title>
<headline>Mannesmann takes stake in Cegetel.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mannesmann AG said it would take a 10 percent stake in Cegetel, telecommunications unit of France's Cie Generale des Eaux, which it could raise to 15 percent in the future.  </p>
<p>Degetel is a new company in which Generale des Eaux will concentrate its telecommunications activities.</p>
<p>British Telecom is expected to take a 25 percent stake, and SBC of the U.S. a 15 percent stake, Mannesmann said.</p>
<p>Mannesmann said its cooperation with CGE would at first concentrate on mobile telecommunications, but would later branch out to fixed-line telecommunications and value-added services.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
